# LF is mandatory in this repository.
#
# The image executes .devcontainer/scripts/runtime/*.sh with /bin/sh and relies
# on "RUN ... \" line continuations in the Dockerfiles. A CRLF checkout breaks
# both: sh sees "set -eu\r" as an invalid option and dies on every container
# start, and BuildKit's continuation handling is not CRLF-safe either.
#
# This is developed on Windows, where core.autocrlf=true is the default and
# would rewrite every text file to CRLF on checkout. These rules pin it to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# --- Windows-native files keep CRLF ----------------------------------------
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# --- must never be rewritten or diffed as text ------------------------------
# Hash-pinned lockfile: byte changes invalidate every download in the image.
.devcontainer/requirements-freecad-mcp.lock text eol=lf -diff

# The extracted AppImage tree is a binary payload, never checked in.
*.AppImage binary
*.squashfs-root/** binary